Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Aspect_of_the_Wolf\">Condition: Aspect of the Wolf</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf (Condition)\">Aspect of the Wolf</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;18 m (60 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +<a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dexterity Modifier\">Dexterity Modifier</a> bonus to Stealth <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Checks</a>, as long as it stays near the barbarian.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Aura\">Sources of Aspect of the Wolf Aura</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf\">Aspect of the Wolf</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>ASPECT_OF_THE_WOLF</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Aspect_of_the_Wolf\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf (Condition)\">Aspect of the Wolf</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +<a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dexterity Modifier\">Dexterity Modifier</a> bonus to Stealth <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Checks</a>, as long as it stays near the barbarian.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Aura\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Aspect of the Wolf Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aspect of the Wolf Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Aspect_of_the_Wolf_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Aspect of the Wolf Aura</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity and nearby allies have a +<a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dexterity Modifier\">Dexterity Modifier</a> bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> Checks.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234354\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2502/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32766/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7151/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4